# The private charter overlay. A project's sharpened charters name its own
# incidents, which is exactly what makes them work and exactly what must not
# be published. Kept local, merged at run time.
charters.local.md

# A consuming project's real configuration and run state. Anchored at the root
# on purpose: examples/toy-project ships its own filled-in pair, and they must
# be committed or the documented first run has nothing to read.
/graph-review.config.json
/graph-review-state.json
